(
    title: "Cosmic Creeps",
    description: Some("Played in two acts under a doomsday clock: first pilot an Orbinaut from the decaying planet through red plasma and Space Skeeters to the space station\'s flashing portals — every Orbinaut lost drops the planet a notch, and twelve notches is oblivion. Reaching the station starts the rescue proper: take control of it and save the Cosmic Kids before their world falls out of orbit."),
